Package: basilisk-v4-tray
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Basilisk V4 Tray <349477269+ashrynsilkstone-ui@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-dbus, python3-openrazer, python3-pyqt6 | python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyqt6 | python3-pyside6.qtdbus, qt6-wayland
Homepage: https://github.com/ashrynsilkstone-ui/basilisk-v4-tray
Description: KDE tray status and settings for the Razer Basilisk V4 Pro
 Watch battery, DPI stage and polling rate over USB or HyperSpeed.
 The settings dialog controls DPI stages, polling, power and per-zone lighting
 through a compatible OpenRazer driver and daemon.
